<body><main class="wrap"><section class="story"><div class="brand"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>eRPH Pro</span></div><div><span class="eyebrow">School workspace</span><h1>One calm place for better teaching.</h1><p>{{ $school->name }} keeps teacher records, daily lesson plans and school visibility in one focused workspace.</p></div><div class="quote">Secure access for your school team · {{ $school->subdomain }}.erphpro.com</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">{{ $school->name }}</div><h2>Welcome back.</h2><p class="muted">Sign in with the Google Workspace account provided by your school. Your access and activity remain tied to this school.</p>@if(config('services.google.client_id'))<div id="g_id_onload" data-client_id="{{ config('services.google.client_id') }}" data-login_uri="{{ route('auth.google.one-tap') }}" data-auto_prompt="true"></div><div class="g_id_signin" data-type="standard" data-size="large" data-theme="outline" data-text="signin_with" data-shape="rectangular" data-logo_alignment="left"></div><script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script><div class="foot">Google may show your active account here. You can always use the standard Google button below.</div>@endif<a class="google" href="{{ route('auth.google.redirect') }}"><span aria-hidden="true">G</span> Continue with Google Workspace</a>@if(!config('services.google.client_id'))<div class="notice">Google Workspace login is not configured on this development environment yet. The connection point is ready for the school administrator’s OAuth credentials.</div>@endif<div class="foot">Need access? Ask your school administrator to invite your account.</div></div></section></main></body></html>
